<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Kimberly Clark Mexico.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Kimberly Clark Mexico.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Dresdner Kleinwort Benson analyst Rene Kleyweg said Monday he had raised his rating on Kimberly Clark de Mexico SA de CV to buy from sell.</p>
<p>-- &quot;As always, on an earnings valuation basis KCM remains expensive. However, with the imminent completion of the disposal program (of the Sancta feminine hygiene line), a stronger longer-term earnings outlook and foreign investors returning to the Mexico market, we are upgrading our recommendation to buy,&quot; it said.</p>
<p>-- The company's shares were down 2.30 pesos to 170.60 in Mexico City.</p>
<p>((-- Ian Simpson, Wall Street Desk, (212) 859-1879))</p>
